    <briefdescription>
<para>A private class template which derives from <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_a_a_results_1_1_concept" kindref="compound">Concept</ref></computeroutput> and wraps some other type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This models the concept by directly forwarding each interface point to the wrapped type which must implement a compatible interface. This provides a type erased binding. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
